# Unlocking a Myth: Warrior (jeuno 102): finishes outside their state, and the main job read by each check. Main, a
# WAR wearing the Sturdy Axe: 10086 (1) open, the quest set accepted by a GM: finished 1: no 10086 handler while
# accepted (not begun again). Cid, a WAR with the quest accepted and an unworn Sturdy Axe at 250 points: 10088 (1) open,
# the quest set completed by a GM: finished: no 10088 handler (no MYTHIC_LEARNED, no King's Justice). Bob, a MNK with a
# Sturdy Axe in his bag: the Warrior's quest is silent on another main job (its available check reads the main job);
# Zalsuhm answers the Monk's quest, not wearing Burning Fists: 10085. The WAR quest accepted on bob by a GM: the trade
# of the axe: the accepted check reads the main job: no section, nothing; the trigger: the Monk's quest's 10085.
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10086 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10088
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-116 job=MNK lvl=75
char cid zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-119 job=WAR lvl=75
item SturdyAxe wsp=0
bob: item SturdyAxe wsp=250
cid: quest Jeuno.UnlockingAMythWarrior accepted
cid: item SturdyAxe wsp=250
login
equip SturdyAxe Main                    # the Main slot
trigger Zalsuhm                         # wearing it: 10086 (1)
quest Jeuno.UnlockingAMythWarrior accepted # a GM, while 10086 is open
finish option=1                         # no 10086 finish while accepted: nothing
cid: login
cid: trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1         # accepted, 250 >= 250: 10088 (1)
cid: quest Jeuno.UnlockingAMythWarrior completed # a GM, while 10088 is open
cid: finish                             # no 10088 finish while completed: nothing
bob: login
bob: trigger Zalsuhm                    # a MNK: the WAR quest silent; the Monk quest: not wearing Burning Fists: 10085
bob: finish
bob: quest Jeuno.UnlockingAMythWarrior accepted # a GM: the WAR quest accepted on a MNK
bob: trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1         # the accepted check reads the main job: no section; nothing
bob: trigger Zalsuhm                    # the Monk quest: 10085
bob: finish
